@startuml architecture
title Practica 4 - Arquitectura de Microservicios

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Cliente

package "Docker Compose - red practica4-net" {
  component "API Gateway\n(Node.js + TypeScript + Express)\n:4000 (publicado al host)" as Gateway

  component "ms-users\n(Node.js + TypeScript + Express)\nREST + GraphQL\n:4001" as Users
  component "ms-products\n(Node.js + TypeScript + Express)\nREST + GraphQL\n:4002" as Products
  component "ms-orders\n(Python + FastAPI)\nREST\n:4003" as Orders
  component "ms-notifications\n(Python + FastAPI)\nREST\n:4004" as Notifications
}

Cliente --> Gateway : HTTP (unico punto de entrada)

Gateway --> Users : /api/users/*  (proxy HTTP)
Gateway --> Products : /api/products/*  (proxy HTTP)
Gateway --> Orders : /api/orders/*  (proxy HTTP)
Gateway --> Notifications : /api/notifications/*  (proxy HTTP)

note right of Gateway
  No contiene logica de negocio.
  Middleware de autenticacion preparado
  (stub) para integrar la Practica 2.
end note

note bottom of Users
  Datos mock en memoria.
  No hay base de datos.
end note

note bottom of Orders
  Datos mock en memoria.
  No hay base de datos.
end note

@enduml
